tweets.text:
A vessel made landfall in Los Almendros Beach in Camuy, Puerto Rico. USBP alongside Puerto Rico Police Department Fuerzas Unidas de Rapida Accion (FURA) conducted an extensive search of the area and discovered 126 bricks of cocaine concealed inside blue plastic containers. Additionally, a handgun, magazine, and ammunition were also discovered within the load. Two illegal aliens from the Dominican Republic associated to this smuggling attempt were arrested. 

The case was turned over to HSI for investigation and prosecution. 
@usbpchiefrmy

